{"id":"ce774aac70609584","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_TConst.md","title":"TConst","display":"TConst","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"TConst","parameters":["a0","t"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"TConst"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a0</span><span>t</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型语法。有序参数：<code>a0</code>、<code>t</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ TConst a0 t)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z717 (and (= z717 a0) (@ Node33a1 z717 t)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cee094d63ea7e369\" href=\"?note=cee094d63ea7e369\" title=\"ZFC_Node33a1\">Node33a1</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ TConst a0 t)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Node33a1","status":"resolved","id":"cee094d63ea7e369","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Node33a1|Node33a1]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":746,"backlinks":[{"id":"c33d10790a9d2114","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_TConst|TConst]]"},{"id":"b05776a499b0b211","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"a77b5a03ac02b86e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"fdfc544c5b0355ce","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_LShift|LShift]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"767af712ef9f884c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Add|Add]]；[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"f7c67b5ebe0aba12","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_AnyRaw|AnyRaw]]；[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]"},{"id":"23ae0c7821c928ba","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Cons|Cons]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_STConstInterp|STConstInterp]]；[[ZFC_STInter